ated_at":"2026-05-06T16:13:00.000Z"},{"id":"KFZAHZmMu","title":"It\u2019s so frustrating that Apple Vision Pro doesn\u2019t let you watch movies while mirroring the display. \n\nIt\u2019s nearly impossible to walk people through the experience without seeing the display, and there\u2019s nothing to do in there but watch videos.","url":"https://x.com/baconbrix/status/2050773922782785666","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/it-s-so-frustrating-that-apple-vision-pro-doesn-t-let-you-watch-movies-while-mirroring-the-display--kfzahzmmu","summary":"A user expresses frustration that Apple Vision Pro prevents watching movies while screen mirroring, making it difficult to demonstrate the device's experience to others since video content is the primary use case.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--HRgLpUt6--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2003","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-03T03:06:19.000Z"},{"id":"Pu9DORiMl","title":"Upgrading expo is incredibly useful","url":"https://x.com/baconbrix/status/2050635170861264971","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/upgrading-expo-is-incredibly-useful-pu9doriml","summary":"Upgrading Expo is highlighted as a highly beneficial practice for React Native developers, though the post provides minimal detail beyond this assertion.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--ZrL_HSsR--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2006","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-02T17:54:58.000Z"},{"id":"0oSyeVJHJ","title":"I added AR support to my Lego models so iPhone users can see how big they look in real life, and look inside.\n\nNo downloads, works right from the browser! \n\nTry it now \u2193","url":"https://x.com/baconbrix/status/2050606490134929590","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/i-added-ar-support-to-my-lego-models-so-iphone-users-can-see-how-big-they-look-in-real-life-and-loo-0osyevjhj","summary":"A developer added augmented reality (AR) su